WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Luke holds heavy Flash Knuckle during the approach.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.150
Ryu blocks the held heavy Flash Knuckle.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.450
Crouching light kick reaches Ryu after the guarded Knuckle.

4
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.000
Crouching light punch links from the low.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.100
Regular light Flash Knuckle knocks Ryu down.
